            "detailed_description": "Quarantine has been declared throughout Jupiter orbit due to outbreak of unknown disease. All the pilots are grounded except for the few ones allowed to participate in training battles.<br>Join their ranks for blazing fast space battles with another players in this top-down shooter game.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/715810/extras/1a90c8a2cfb995e049b30a31321a450f.poster.avif?t=1657308427\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/715810/extras/1a90c8a2cfb995e049b30a31321a450f.webm?t=1657308427\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/715810/extras/1a90c8a2cfb995e049b30a31321a450f.mp4?t=1657308427\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >16 pre-built classes, more than 200 skills and 4 different battleground game types:</h2>Capture the Flag, Battle Royale and Dungeon Raid. All those games have different mechanics and require cooperative efforts to master.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Various weapon mechanics</h2>Different types of weapons allows you either to do mass damage, penetrate a shield or lay a trap.<br>Each weapon category bears it's own unique mechanics and combat tactics:<br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Rockets - high damage explosives<br></li><li>Torpedoes - guided missiles<br></li><li>Lasers - beam weapons with 100% shield penetration<br></li><li>Machine guns - kinetic weapons with extra damage to unshielded targets</li></ul><br>Project Thebe ",
            "about_the_game": "Quarantine has been declared throughout Jupiter orbit due to outbreak of unknown disease. All the pilots are grounded except for the few ones allowed to participate in training battles.<br>Join their ranks for blazing fast space battles with another players in this top-down shooter game.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/715810/extras/1a90c8a2cfb995e049b30a31321a450f.poster.avif?t=1657308427\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/715810/extras/1a90c8a2cfb995e049b30a31321a450f.webm?t=1657308427\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/715810/extras/1a90c8a2cfb995e049b30a31321a450f.mp4?t=1657308427\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >16 pre-built classes, more than 200 skills and 4 different battleground game types:</h2>Capture the Flag, Battle Royale and Dungeon Raid. All those games have different mechanics and require cooperative efforts to master.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Various weapon mechanics</h2>Different types of weapons allows you either to do mass damage, penetrate a shield or lay a trap.<br>Each weapon category bears it's own unique mechanics and combat tactics:<br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Rockets - high damage explosives<br></li><li>Torpedoes - guided missiles<br></li><li>Lasers - beam weapons with 100% shield penetration<br></li><li>Machine guns - kinetic weapons with extra damage to unshielded targets</li></ul><br>Project Thebe ",
